// `??` unwraps a fallible value, so a left side that is already a single concrete type has nothing
// to fall back FROM — the fallback is dead code and both backends abort on it at run time. The
// checker used to yield `Unknown` here, which unified with anything and let the program check
// clean, so the failure only surfaced when the line actually ran (a map lookup with a default was
// the common way to hit it: `m[k] ?? d` — a map index yields the value type, not an option).
// expect: error E0007 at 9:6
// expect: exit 1
m = { "a": "1" }
echo m["a"] ?? "absent"
